    <comment>- Update to 1.40.1:
  * Add JAEC native inference pipeline (audio/AEC)
  * Add FLA-TF-Locoformer and FLA-T-SepReformer 2-speaker
    8 kHz speech separators, with ONNX export
  * Add Agent IDP (key rotation, signed tokens) and MCP
    Studio OpenAPI (deploy_mcp_server / undeploy_mcp_server)
  * Require python-modelscope-hub &gt;= 0.4.2</comment>
